@backend = http://localhost:3000

### Check backend

GET {{backend}}/health

### Make login
# @name login
# @prompt email Send mail to the test user
# @prompt password Password for the test user

POST {{backend}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get authenticated user

GET {{backend}}/auth/me

### Logout

POST {{backend}}/auth/logout

### Get how to play 

GET {{backend}}/how-to-play/scar

### Get how to play in spanish

GET {{backend}}/how-to-play/scar?lang=es